<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n84745" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πολύ̆-δακρῠς</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῠος</span>, ὁ, ἡ,
			(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δάκρυ</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>of</i> or <i>with many tears</i>: hence,
			</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>I.</b>
			<i>muchwept, lamented,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἄρης, πόλεμος, ὑσμίνη,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Il.
				3.132
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				165
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				17.544
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μῆτις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					B.
					15.24
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἴτνς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Av.</u>
					212
				</span></i>
			 (anap.); <i>tearful,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἰαχά, γόος,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Pers.</u>
				940
			</span></i> (lyr.), <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ch.</u>
				449
			</span></i> (lyr.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. ἁδονά</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>El.</u>
					126
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> of
			persons, <i>much-weeping,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Ph.</u>
				366
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Supp.Epigr.</u>
				4.719
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Bithynia</span>).</div>
